ight be more current. Let me pull up the actual table structure to confirm which fields are available.\n\nThe main work items I'm tracking are the 57 tasks distributed across the two tables, with knowledge consolidation blocked by the token issue, one subtask already completed, two dead records that were already marked, and the AI collaboration table showing mostly pending items. I need to create a new check record, update the timestamp to 1745112660000, and then decide whether to write to the shared pool progress table.\n\nFor the timestamp conversion, 1745112660000 milliseconds is 2026-04-18T02:11:00Z, which is exactly the current time the cron is running at UTC+0, so that's correct. Let me finalize these updates and continue."},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me update the heartbeat and create the new check record:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_volsr2yu0e32_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table_id":"tblt4LNepLsvevNr","fields":{"任务名称":"【小柱】任务看板自动检查 2026-04-18 02:11","龙虾归属":"小柱","最后心跳":1745112660000,"负责人":["小柱"],"任务描述":"自动心跳检查：看板57任务（3Done+5Dead历史+小八1Blocked+全员1Running+56条检查记录）；AI协作表6任务（1进行中+5待执行-小妙）；无新增Dead；心跳更新1745112660000","子Agent":["心跳检查Cron"],"超时分钟":0}}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_volsr2yu0e32_2","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"memory/heartbeat-state.json","content":"{\n  \"last_heartbeat\": \"2026-04-18T02:11:00Z\",\n  \"instance\": \"小柱\",\n  \"status\": \"活跃\",\n  \"auto_check_job_id\": \"53656e40-4892-4759-a73e-a11dc01082b5\"\n}\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776478288870,"responseId":"06321b51964dd74270f6b934ada9076d"}}
